Build-time embed
----------------

### SQLite (public domain / blessing)

The default `sqlite` Cargo feature builds rusqlite with the
`bundled` feature, which compiles the SQLite amalgamation into the
binary. SQLite is in the public domain (https://sqlite.org/copyright.html).
The amalgamation is not vendored in this tree; it arrives via crates.io
at build time.

Crate dependencies pulled from crates.io at build time carry their
own licences in Cargo.lock / crates.io metadata and are not copied
into this repository.
